  "invariants": [
    "Scrape /agent.json, /api/status, /api/runs/history — not HTML.",
    "need = block_size * batch_size + 1 tokens before one optimizer step.",
    "V-JEPA Hub rows are 50–200 tokens. FineWeb rows are thousands. Same batch is a category error.",
    "MCF v2: pack 128 frames, batch 256 (micro 64×4), stop on tokens (~1.5B / 5.25 GB), not 24 GB unpacked.",
    "Do not escalate a sokoban-only smoke (loss→0.15) as proof the recipe scales.",
    "Finetune requires a pretrained checkpoint. Seed-only SFT from scratch fails around 17M (loss ~5+).",
    "Pretrain lr 2e-4–3e-4; finetune lr 1e-5–1e-4. Toggle the scaling table first.",
    "AUTO_RESUME=1 on app8: POST reset-session and resume:false before a new recipe.",
    "Keep MAX_CHECKPOINTS_KEEP; app8 filled the disk at 31 checkpoints.",
    "RM delta within ~0.1 is noise. Negative delta = discard and roll back.",
    "Do not stop a healthy FineWeb/SWE run on one lab to unblock V-JEPA on another.",
    "Loss <1 on polluted mixed streams is overfit, not success."
  ],
